<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-023" chapter-id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen" source-id="s-nanshi-023-wangfen-ws2478204">
  <p id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p001:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p001:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AB">份</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AB">份</persName>曰：「陛下應萬物為有，體至理為無。」帝稱善。後累遷尚書左僕射。曆侍中，特進，左光祿大夫，監丹陽尹。卒，諡曰鬍子。長子<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002:m0059" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABA">琳</persName>，字<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002:m0062" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABA">孝璋</persName>，位司徒左長史。<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002:m0072" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABA">琳</persName>齊代取梁武帝妹義興長公主，有子九人，並知名。
長子<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002:m0098" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAA">銓</persName>，字<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002:m0101" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAA">公衡</persName>，美風儀，善占吐，尚武帝女永嘉公主，拜駙馬都尉。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p003" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p003:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAA">銓</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p003:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAB">錫</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p003:m0004" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAB">公嘏</persName>，幼而警悟，與兄弟受業，至應休散，輒獨留不起，精力不倦，致損右目。</p>
</text>
